<title>LATVIA: SAULES BANK 7-MO PROFIT 822,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>SAULES BANK 7-MO PROFIT 822,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven months 1997.</p>
<p>				  (million lats unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit					  822,000 lats</p>
<p> Assets						56.92</p>
<p> Claims on other credit institutions	 27.34</p>
<p> Deposits					    33.79</p>
<p> Individuals deposits			    11.48</p>
<p> Net loans					    9.64</p>
<p> Securities and bonds			     7.49</p>
<p>NOTE - Saules Bank provided no comparisons for the figures.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
